    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d3">

                <pb facs="0043" n="6" xml:id="pg6"/>

                <head>3. Memorandum From the President’s Assistant for National Security Affairs
                    (Brzezinski) to Director of Central Intelligence Turner<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d3-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1977-06-08">June 8, 1977</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Angola</item>
                </list>
                <p>With reference to our forthcoming African review, the NSC needs an assessment of
                    the present scope and longer-term prospects of Savimbi’s guerilla activities in
                        Angola.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d3-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Zbigniew Brzezinski</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
